  "structure": {
    "block_count": 32,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "5 Tips for Traveling with Baby",
        "text_sha256": "788bd6d642c5b1b58f143b863e34d55d722ed5ae8b84e012fb81e6dc0cdde694",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Traveling with a baby can be tough. Here are some mom-tested tips for surviving - and even enjoying - the journey!",
        "text_sha256": "338b7d9d1860c711ce03b399b6cc0cc5d8ecdad82419babe7a504ad178bacd16",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "1. Ditch the Stroller",
        "text_sha256": "e3abbab98a6344b8b0932f11df8e9762022bda21752c963c48229eae6e659c74",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"Wearing baby keeps him calm and is easier to maneuver through crowds.\" --AdventureKate",
        "text_sha256": "c4339924720f2780315d272c18ac847e610f0c94918b445967e07b19db902643",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "2. Reserve an airplane bassinet.",
        "text_sha256": "ff76df90c1c6ab18df4d4f1b8a52d0e4d313f48074555e995c38e8a6e1c6a028",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"The bassinet makes all the difference in the world! It literally was our lifesaver!\" -- AnoshkaMKhan",
        "text_sha256": "5de844409de35d6d4a4df6cb0e9b1571aa06572012899e49bba4f61d77f5781a",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "3. Dress for Success",
        "text_sha256": "76d867f17b6a2131a93ee55af88d673175b456478de704821ba5746be8ce44d5",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"Dress baby in comfy fleece pajamas since it gets pretty cold on the plane. Pack a change of clothes for both of you in case of any mishaps during your travels.\" -- MamaDesperado",
        "text_sha256": "baf133ab0e0b145e6a387d12b49bceac912648236b50f26b341f5c5876786678",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "4. Avoid Earaches",
        "text_sha256": "df811292d60e82e72d5c437495e74efe976f41ab4e8a48ded1665d454cb85442",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"Have him suck on something (paci/bottle/breast) during take-off and landing.\" -- vr1",
        "text_sha256": "8be06906bb59adf2a8d4ad731143c1d0f015183572ee18dc8ee262d29cce6a00",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "5. Be Good to Fellow Travelers",
        "text_sha256": "81bc144c746723b9ab7fd4f8dda3b2b424e5a612b7724bcc4cbb78b4eae74bdd",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"My baby likes to yell, so I'm making a double-sided 'sorry!' sign to raise as needed.\" --Soudie",
        "text_sha256": "549e0c678592fae69f650d2b020d2f3cd0cce64a9884097f0cf770ffd1ac7e0f",
        "word_count": 17
      },
